Heals your Tamed Pet for health over 15 sec.

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

@ext:Tamed Pet includes Summoned Demon, Enslave Demon, Dominate Undead, Tame Dragonkin, Tether Elemental, Summoned Ghoul, and Tame Beast.:ext@

Increases your melee attack speed by 20%. In addition, attacks strike an additional nearby opponent. Lasts 20 sec.

@ext:Can't be active at the same time as Sweeping Strikes.
 
This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Unleashes the energy of a Seal spell to judge an enemy for 20 sec, granting auto attacks and auto shots made against the judged enemy a chance of healing the attacker for 2% of their base health. 

@ext:Refer to individual Seals for additional Judgement effect.:ext@

@ext:Only one Judgement per Paladin can be active at any one time.:ext@

Increases all damage and healing caused by 20% for 20 sec.

Cannot be used within 30 sec of being the target of Divine Shield, Divine Protection, or Hand of Protection, or of using Lay on Hands on oneself.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

Strengthens you with the presence of blood, increasing damage by 2% and heals you for 1% of your damage dealt.

@ext:Only one Presence may be active at a time.:ext@

